                                "sense_id": "164b95e9-132d-359f-89d4-42373fe4776d",
                                "text": "Pippin could see all the Pelennor laid out before him, dotted into the distance with farmsteads and little walls, barns and byres, but nowhere could he see any kine or other beasts."
